#: src/bz-application.c:1060
msgid ""
"Ubuntu 25.10 and newer have changed default security rules in a way that "
"makes it <b>impossible to install apps</b> from the Flatpak version of "
"Bazaar. For the time being, please use the apt package instead. Install it "
"with\n"
"\n"
"<tt>sudo apt install bazaar</tt>\n"
"\n"
"You can then remove this Flatpak version with\n"
"\n"
"<tt>flatpak uninstall io.github.kolunmi.Bazaar</tt>"
msgstr ""

